WEBVTT

00:00:58.137 --> 00:01:01.015
that our brains literally
can't process it,

00:01:01.057 --> 00:01:03.684
and we fill in the world with patterns.

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:09.023
Much of what we see
is our own expectations.

00:01:09.899 --> 00:01:11.192
All right.

00:01:11.192 --> 00:01:12.944
I'm going to show you a little trick

00:01:12.985 --> 00:01:17.031
to rewire your brain into looking again.

00:01:17.406 --> 00:01:20.660
Did you all get an envelope
that says "do not open" on it?

00:01:20.701 --> 00:01:23.162
Grab that envelope, it's time to open it.

00:01:23.871 --> 00:01:28.334
Inside should be
a piece of paper and a pencil.

00:01:29.585 --> 00:01:31.087
Once you have that all prepped,